{"seq":2,"slug":"chinese-writing","title":"中文写作","stage":"DONE","category":"writing","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing","rating":{"composite":3.65,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.55,"verdict":"consider","uScore":3.75}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"中文写作-简介\">中文写作 简介</h1><p>中文写作是表达思想、传递信息和记录知识的核心能力。在信息爆炸的时代，无论是撰写工作报告、公众号文章、产品文案还是学术论文，高质量的中文写作能力都是个人竞争力的重要体现。良好的写作不仅需要扎实的语言功底，更需要清晰的逻辑思维和敏锐的读者意识——写作的本质，是替读者把一团模糊的想法整理成可被理解、可被信任的有序结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"适合读者\">适合读者</h2><p>本知识库面向所有希望提升中文写作水平的学习者，特别是技术背景的从业者。如果你觉得自己&quot;想法很多但写不出来&quot;，或者&quot;写出来的东西准确但缺乏吸引力&quot;，这里将为你提供系统化的训练方法和实用技巧。</p>\n<p>本书不要求任何文学或写作专业背景，但默认你愿意把写作当作一项可刻意练习的工程能力来对待，而非靠灵感的玄学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"章节概览\">章节概览</h2><p>全书分为五章，遵循「打基础 → 分文体 → 求表达」的脉络，由通用功底逐步走向具体场景与个人风格。</p>\n<p>第一章 <strong>写作基础</strong>，训练遣词造句、逻辑与结构、语体与语域、标点格式，以及修辞技巧——这是一切文体共用的底层功夫。</p>\n<p>第二章 <strong>议论文写作</strong>，聚焦论点与论据、逻辑论证、学术论文与时评社论，解决&quot;如何把一个观点讲得有说服力&quot;。</p>\n<p>第三章 <strong>叙事写作</strong>，讲解叙事结构、人物与对话、场景与氛围、散文随笔，解决&quot;如何把一件事讲得有画面、有温度&quot;。</p>\n<p>第四章 <strong>应用写作</strong>，覆盖商务邮件、报告与总结、提案与计划、新闻稿——职场中最高频、最看重效率与准确的实用文体。</p>\n<p>第五章 <strong>创意表达</strong>，延伸到诗歌韵文、文案、社交媒体内容与跨文化写作，帮助你在掌握规范之后形成独特的文字个性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>推荐先精读第一章打牢基础，再根据自己的现实需求挑选文体章节深入：职场读者优先第四章应用写作，自媒体与内容创作者侧重第三、五章，需要写论文或做技术论证的读者主攻第二章。基础与文体之间是「地基与楼层」的关系——跳过第一章直接学文体技巧，写出来的东西往往结构松散、经不起细看。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"writing-basics","title":"写作基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/writing-basics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"logic-and-structure","title":"逻辑与结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/writing-basics/logic-and-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"style-and-register","title":"风格与语域","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/writing-basics/style-and-register"},{"seq":3,"slug":"punctuation-and-formatting","title":"标点与排版","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/writing-basics/punctuation-and-formatting"},{"seq":4,"slug":"rhetoric-and-techniques","title":"修辞与技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/writing-basics/rhetoric-and-techniques"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"argumentative-writing","title":"议论文写作","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/argumentative-writing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"thesis-and-evidence","title":"论点与论据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/argumentative-writing/thesis-and-evidence"},{"seq":2,"slug":"logical-reasoning","title":"逻辑推理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/argumentative-writing/logical-reasoning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"academic-paper","title":"学术论文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/argumentative-writing/academic-paper"},{"seq":4,"slug":"commentary-and-editorial","title":"时评与社论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/argumentative-writing/commentary-and-editorial"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"narrative-writing","title":"叙事写作","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/narrative-writing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"narrative-structure","title":"叙事结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/narrative-writing/narrative-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"character-and-dialogue","title":"人物与对话","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/narrative-writing/character-and-dialogue"},{"seq":3,"slug":"scene-and-atmosphere","title":"场景与氛围","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/narrative-writing/scene-and-atmosphere"},{"seq":4,"slug":"essay-and-prose","title":"散文与随笔","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/narrative-writing/essay-and-prose"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practical-writing","title":"实用写作","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/practical-writing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"business-email","title":"商务邮件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/practical-writing/business-email"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reports-and-summaries","title":"报告与总结","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/practical-writing/reports-and-summaries"},{"seq":3,"slug":"proposals-and-plans","title":"方案与计划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/practical-writing/proposals-and-plans"},{"seq":4,"slug":"press-releases","title":"新闻稿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/practical-writing/press-releases"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"creative-expression","title":"创意表达","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/creative-expression","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"poetry-and-verse","title":"诗歌与韵文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/creative-expression/poetry-and-verse"},{"seq":2,"slug":"copywriting","title":"文案写作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/creative-expression/copywriting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"social-media-content","title":"社交媒体内容","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/creative-expression/social-media-content"},{"seq":4,"slug":"cross-cultural-writing","title":"跨文化写作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/chinese-writing/creative-expression/cross-cultural-writing"}]}]}